<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8" data-next-head=""/><script id="usercentrics-autoblocker" src="https://web.cmp.usercentrics.eu/modules/autoblocker.js" data-next-head=""></script><script id="usercentrics-cmp" src="https://web.cmp.usercentrics.eu/ui/loader.js" data-ruleset-id="8W4QKLTl3zwcNw" async="" data-next-head=""></script><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Scopely","url":"https://scopely.com"}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Scopely?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Scopely is expanding the possibilities of play through game experiences that aim to inspire community, connection, competition and play, every day. Founded in 2011, Scopely is home to many top-grossing, award-winning game experiences on mobile, web, PC and beyond. The company is fueled by a world-class team and a proprietary technology platform, Playgami, that supports an extremely diverse portfolio of experiences. Scopely has been recognized by Fast Company as one of the World's most innovative companies and by TIME as one of the TIME100 Most Influential Companies."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What games does Scopely make?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Scopely is dedicated to expanding the possibilities of play with a diverse portfolio of top-grossing titles including MONOPOLY GO!, Pokémon GO, Stumble Guys, Star Trek Fleet Command, MARVEL Strike Force, Scrabble GO, and Yahtzee With Buddies, among others. Each Scopely game team is a collection of game makers who share a unique creative culture and are focused on creating memorable experiences for players."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Playgami?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Playgami is Scopely's proprietary end-to-end technology platform and the foundation of Scopely's success. It underpins the replicable and durable success of Scopely's games by supporting expertise in game design and development, live operations, marketing, analytics and more. Playgami empowers players to play their own way by enabling deep experiences that inspire play, every day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I contact Scopely?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Drop Scopely a line at https://scopely.com/contact — they would love to hear from you. The contact form supports inquiries for Developer Partners, Press, and Careers. For player support, visit the Scopely support site where you've got questions and they've got answers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Scopely hiring?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — Scopely is hiring across a wide range of roles. Join a passionate team around the globe and work in a rewarding environment with other incredibly talented people. All Scopely employees are SCOPELEANS, united by a shared purpose and sense of pride that inspires ambitious teams to achieve their goals. Explore open positions at https://scopely.com/careers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get support for a Scopely game?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For player support, visit the Scopely customer support site at https://scopely.com/customer-support. You've got questions — Scopely's got answers. The support site provides help resources for each Scopely title."}}]}</script><title data-next-head="">Scopely | Global interactive Mobile-first video game company</title><meta name="description" content="Scopely is expanding the possibilities of play through game experiences that aim to inspire community, connection and competition. Inspire play, every day." data-next-head=""/><meta name="viewport" content="initial-scale=1.0, width=device-width, maximum-scale=5.0" data-next-head=""/><meta name="google-site-verification" content="cOL568CEu9jGHhjHCYRaogRiXoF_MUkmTBL0B7hcUg4" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:t